#: templates/ai_fill_bulk.html:60
msgid ""
"AI Fill for many games at once. The AI fills each game's empty fields, "
"such as genre, release dates and copies sold, the same way the AI Fill "
"button on a game's page does, and saves them straight to the game. Games "
"AI Fill has already done are skipped, so a second run only does the rest."
msgstr ""
"AI-vul vir baie speletjies gelyk. Die KI vul elke speletjie se leë velde,"
" soos genre, vrystellingsdatums en kopieë verkoop, op dieselfde manier as"
" die AI-vul-knoppie op 'n speletjie se bladsy, en stoor dit reguit in die"
" speletjie. Speletjies wat AI-vul reeds gedoen het, word oorgeslaan, so "
"'n tweede lopie doen net die res."

#: templates/ai_fill_bulk.html:61
msgid ""
"Your AI provider charges for each game. With Claude Haiku 5.5 and web "
"search on, a game costs at most about 5 US cents."
msgstr ""
"Jou KI-verskaffer vra geld vir elke speletjie. Met Claude Haiku 5.5 en "
"websoek aan kos 'n speletjie hoogstens omtrent 5 VS-sent."

