"The player picks the best core for each system and downloads it from the "
"libretro build server the first time you play. Installed cores are never "
"updated by Play; update them here."
msgstr ""
"Die speler kies die beste core vir elke stelsel en laai dit die eerste "
"keer dat jy speel van die libretro-bouediener af. Geïnstalleerde cores "
"word nooit deur “Speel” opgedateer nie; dateer hulle hier op."

