msgstr ""
"Cores word nie vir hierdie rekenaar gebou nie, dus kan RetroDB hulle nie "
"aflaai nie."

#: templates/settings_emulators.html:131
msgid ""
"Download the free public cheat packs, or import cheat folders you already"
" have. Each game's page then lists its cheats, each with an on/off "
"switch, for games played in RetroDB's RetroArch, DuckStation or PCSX2."
msgstr ""
"Laai die gratis openbare kulkodepakke af, of voer kulkodevouers in wat jy"
" reeds het. Elke speletjie se bladsy lys dan sy kulkodes, elkeen met 'n "
"aan/af-skakelaar, vir speletjies wat in RetroDB se RetroArch, DuckStation"
" of PCSX2 gespeel word."

