msgid "Import a folder"
msgstr "Voer 'n vouer in"

#: templates/settings_emulators.html:139
msgid "Import"
msgstr "Voer in"

#: templates/settings_emulators.html:142
msgid ""
"RetroDB copies the cheat files it recognises and never changes the "
"folder. Import again to pick up new files."
msgstr ""
"RetroDB kopieer die kulkodelêers wat dit herken en verander nooit die "
"vouer nie. Voer weer in om nuwe lêers op te tel."

#: templates/settings_emulators.html:145
msgid ""
"Arcade games in MAME: download the \"MAME XML Cheats Collection\" from <a"
" href=\"https://www.mamecheat.co.uk/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener "
"noreferrer\">mamecheat.co.uk</a> in your browser, then import the folder "
"holding it. RetroDB keeps it packed and reads the cheat names from it, "
"fetching the 7-Zip tool from the internet to do so. Each arcade game's "
"page then lists its cheats with on/off switches."
msgstr ""
"Arcade-speletjies in MAME: laai die \"MAME XML Cheats Collection\" van <a"
" href=\"https://www.mamecheat.co.uk/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener "
"noreferrer\">mamecheat.co.uk</a> in jou blaaier af, en voer dan die vouer"
" in wat dit bevat. RetroDB hou dit ingepak en lees die kulkodenaam "
"daaruit, en haal die 7-Zip-hulpmiddel van die internet af om dit te doen."
" Elke arcade-speletjie se bladsy lys dan sy kulkodes met aan/af-"
"skakelaars."

#: templates/settings_emulators.html:148
msgid ""
"Arcade games with RetroAchievements play in FinalBurn Neo in RetroArch "
"(RetroDB), since RetroAchievements does not support MAME. Download its "
"cheat pack above; each such game's page lists its cheats, which you "
"switch on in RetroArch's menu while you play."
msgstr ""
"Arcade-speletjies met RetroAchievements speel in FinalBurn Neo in "
"RetroArch (RetroDB), aangesien RetroAchievements nie MAME ondersteun nie."
" Laai die kulkodepakket hierbo af; elke sulke speletjie se bladsy lys sy "
"kulkodes, wat jy in RetroArch se kieslys aanskakel terwyl jy speel."

