"Kry jou API-sleutel by die <a "
"href=\"https://retroachievements.org/controlpanel.php\" target=\"_blank\""
" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"color: var(--primary-cyan"
");\">RetroAchievements-beheerpaneel</a>"

#: templates/_settings_tabs/account.html:118
msgid ""
"Password sign-in: unlock achievements while you play in RetroArch, "
"DuckStation and PCSX2"
msgstr ""
"Wagwoord-aanmelding: ontsluit prestasies terwyl jy in RetroArch, "
"DuckStation en PCSX2 speel"

#: templates/_settings_tabs/account.html:119
msgid ""
"Sign in once and your achievements unlock as you play. Your password goes"
" only to RetroAchievements and is not kept; RetroDB keeps the sign-in "
"token it returns."
msgstr ""
"Meld een keer aan en jou prestasies word ontsluit terwyl jy speel. Jou "
"wagwoord gaan net na RetroAchievements en word nie gehou nie; RetroDB hou"
" die aanmeldtoken wat dit terugstuur."

#: templates/_settings_tabs/account.html:119
msgid ""
"When you press Play in DuckStation or PCSX2, RetroDB writes your sign-in "
"to that emulator's own settings file. A sign-in you made in the "
"emulator's own menu is left alone."
msgstr ""
"Wanneer jy Speel in DuckStation of PCSX2 druk, skryf RetroDB jou "
"aanmelding na daardie emulator se eie instellingslêer. 'n Aanmelding wat "
"jy in die emulator se eie kieslys gedoen het, bly onaangeraak."

#: templates/_settings_tabs/account.html:122
