msgstr "Jou PlayStation Network Aanlyn-ID (outomaties opgespoor by koppeling)"

#: templates/_settings_tabs/account.html:155
msgid "NPSSO Token Setup"
msgstr "NPSSO-token Opstelling"

#: templates/_settings_tabs/account.html:162
msgid "Open Sony's account page"
msgstr "Open Sony se rekeningblad"

#: templates/_settings_tabs/account.html:163
msgid ""
"First sign in to PlayStation in this browser. Then open the account page:"
" it shows your NPSSO token as JSON. If you are not signed in, it shows "
"\"Invalid login\" instead."
msgstr ""
"Meld eers in hierdie blaaier by PlayStation aan. Maak dan die "
"rekeningbladsy oop: dit wys jou NPSSO-token as JSON. As jy nie aangemeld "
"is nie, wys dit eerder \"Invalid login\"."

#: templates/_settings_tabs/account.html:164
msgid ""
"Replacing a token that still works? Sign out of PlayStation first, then "
"sign in again. Signing out ends the old token, so Sony gives you a new "
"one."
msgstr ""
"Vervang jy 'n token wat nog werk? Meld eers van PlayStation af en dan "
"weer aan. Afmelding beëindig die ou token, so Sony gee jou 'n nuwe een."

#: templates/_settings_tabs/account.html:166
msgid "Sign in to PlayStation"
msgstr "Meld aan by PlayStation"

#: templates/_settings_tabs/account.html:169
msgid "Open Sony Account Page"
msgstr "Open Sony-rekeningblad"

#: templates/_settings_tabs/account.html:176
msgid ""
"Optional shortcut: drag the button below to your browser's bookmarks bar."
" Then, on the Sony JSON page, click the bookmark to copy your NPSSO in "
"one click."
msgstr ""
"Opsionele kortpad: sleep die knoppie hieronder na jou blaaier se "
"boekmerkbalk. Klik dan, op die Sony JSON-blad, die boekmerk om jou NPSSO "
"met een klik te kopieer."

#: templates/_settings_tabs/account.html:177
msgid "Copy NPSSO"
msgstr "Kopieer NPSSO"

#: templates/_settings_tabs/account.html:186
msgid "Copy the page content"
msgstr "Kopieer die blad se inhoud"

#: templates/_settings_tabs/account.html:187
msgid ""
"Select all (<kbd style=\"background: var(--bg-medium); padding: 1px 6px; "
"border-radius: 3px; border: 1px solid var(--card-border); font-size: "
"0.8rem;\">Ctrl+A</kbd>) and copy (<kbd style=\"background: var(--bg-"
"medium); padding: 1px 6px; border-radius: 3px; border: 1px solid var"
"(--card-border); font-size: 0.8rem;\">Ctrl+C</kbd>). You can copy the "
"entire JSON &mdash; we'll extract the token automatically."
msgstr ""
"Kies alles (<kbd style=\"background: var(--bg-medium); padding: 1px 6px; "
"border-radius: 3px; border: 1px solid var(--card-border); font-size: "
"0.8rem;\">Ctrl+A</kbd>) en kopieer (<kbd style=\"background: var(--bg-"
"medium); padding: 1px 6px; border-radius: 3px; border: 1px solid var"
"(--card-border); font-size: 0.8rem;\">Ctrl+C</kbd>). Jy kan die hele JSON"
" kopieer &mdash; ons sal die token outomaties onttrek."

#: templates/_settings_tabs/account.html:195
