msgstr "Plaas die wyser in die blokkie. Druk dan Ctrl+V."

#: templates/_settings_tabs/account.html:203
msgid "Paste here"
msgstr "Plak hier"

#: templates/_settings_tabs/account.html:211
msgid "Save My Profile at the bottom of this card checks a new token with Sony."
msgstr "Stoor My Profiel onderaan hierdie kaart kontroleer 'n nuwe token by Sony."

#: templates/_settings_tabs/account.html:217
msgid ""
"Xbox reaches RetroDB through OpenXBL, a free service. Sign in at <a "
"href=\"https://xbl.io\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" "
"style=\"color: var(--primary-cyan);\">xbl.io</a> with your Xbox account, "
"copy your API key, and paste it here. The free key allows 150 requests an"
" hour, so a big achievement sync may take more than one go."
msgstr ""
"Xbox bereik RetroDB deur OpenXBL, 'n gratis diens. Meld aan by <a "
"href=\"https://xbl.io\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" "
"style=\"color: var(--primary-cyan);\">xbl.io</a> met jou Xbox-rekening, "
"kopieer jou API-sleutel en plak dit hier. Die gratis sleutel laat 150 "
"versoeke per uur toe, so 'n groot prestasie-sinkronisering kan meer as "
"een keer nodig hê."

#: templates/_settings_tabs/account.html:221
msgid "Your OpenXBL API key"
msgstr "Jou OpenXBL-API-sleutel"

#: templates/_settings_tabs/account.html:231
msgid ""
"Add your own Steam key and Steam ID to import your Steam library and "
