msgstr "Opruiming van wees-media"

#: templates/_settings_tabs/system.html:93
msgid ""
"Find and delete media files (boxart, screenshots, videos, etc.) for ROMs "
"that no longer exist in the database. This cleans up leftover files from "
"deleted games."
msgstr ""
"Vind en verwyder medialêers (bokskuns, skermkiekies, video's, ens.) vir "
"ROM's wat nie meer in die databasis bestaan nie. Dit ruim oorblywende "
"lêers van verwyderde speletjies op."

#: templates/_settings_tabs/system.html:109
msgid "Missing Media References"
msgstr "Ontbrekende mediaverwysings"

#: templates/_settings_tabs/system.html:112
msgid ""
"The reverse of orphaned-media cleanup: find games whose boxart, "
"screenshots, video or manual point to files that are no longer on disk, "
"and clear those stale references so scrapers can re-download them. If a "
"whole media folder looks missing or empty (for example an unmounted "
"drive), its references are kept and flagged rather than wiped."
msgstr ""
"Die omgekeerde van wees-media-opruiming: vind speletjies waarvan die "
"bokskuns, skermkiekies, video of handleiding na lêers wys wat nie meer op"
" die skyf is nie, en vee daardie verouderde verwysings uit sodat skrapers"
" hulle weer kan aflaai. As 'n hele mediagids vermis of leeg lyk "
"(byvoorbeeld 'n ongemonteerde skyf), word sy verwysings behou en gemerk "
"eerder as uitgewis."

